{
  "case": "obrenovic",
  "case_id": null,
  "date": "2004-05-27",
  "utterances": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "speaker": "JUDGE LIU",
      "role": "judge",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "Yes. Now we are in open session. Mr. Karnavas, could you please brief us about the witness situation at this stage."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "speaker": "MR. KARNAVAS",
      "role": "counsel",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "Certainly, Your Honour. Certainly. I suspect you're asking the situation as to why we don't have any witnesses for later on today and tomorrow. Apparently, there was some sort of a mix-up, and -- at least with one of the witnesses there has been some documentation problems. But, but, in light of that -- in spite of that, I should say, there's not going to be a problem as far as meeting our targeted date. That's my expectation. I know that -- because some of these witnesses were rather short. And there may be cause or reason, I should say, to make some adjustments based on the evidence as it's coming in."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "speaker": "MR. KARNAVAS",
      "role": "counsel",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "Mr. Vasic is a rather more complicated witness. I'm sure that there's going to be some cross-examination from Mr. Jokic's lawyers. I'm sure the Prosecutor, at least from the indications that I have, from the remarks in open court, is probably going to be questioning Mr. Vasic. And I would say that I have the better part of a day and a half with Mr. Vasic. And of course, I will be asking that he be declared a hostile witness in every sense of the word. But more precisely, for the purposes of conducting cross-examination, the gentleman obviously was extremely reluctant in coming over here. And it took us close to two and a half years to even arrange a meeting with him. So that's the situation, Your Honours."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "speaker": "JUDGE LIU",
      "role": "judge",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "Thank you. Is there anything Mr. McCloskey would like to raise at this stage?"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "speaker": "MR. MCCLOSKEY",
      "role": "counsel",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "Yes, Your Honour. We may, if we could just go into private session very briefly."
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "speaker": "JUDGE LIU",
      "role": "judge",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "Yes. We'll go to the private session, please."
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "speaker": "JUDGE LIU",
      "role": "judge",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "to be reconvened on Tuesday, the 1st day of June, 2004, at 9.00 a.m. 20 21 22 23 24 25"
    }
  ],
